# Shield: a 10x20 window at x 2..11, y 2..21, front face only. Vanilla spends only an 8x8 corner
# of it; the leaf takes 10x13 (rows 5..17) because seven leaflets do not survive eight pixels.
# Leaflets drop to one pixel wide here, which is what vanilla's own shield sprites do.
@texture entity/shield/hemp_leaf 64x64 type=plant
